Article 8 (Consultation with Local Governments) Where the Minister of the Interior and Safety deems it necessary for the efficient operation of the Integrated Local Finance System, the Minister may consult with the heads of relevant local governments on the following matters:
1. Financial cost-sharing in connection with the Integrated Local Finance System;
2. Work process design and standardization of affairs for the electronic processing of local government finance affairs;
3. Other matters on which the Minister of the Interior and Safety deems consultation with the heads of local governments necessary for the efficient management and operation of the Integrated Local Finance System.
